@startuml Sequence Diagram - Reply to Customer

actor "TeamMember" as TeamMember
participant "ConversationDetailView" as ConvDetailView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

TeamMember -> ConvDetailView : 1 Open conversation detail page
activate ConvDetailView
ConvDetailView -> ConvDetailView : 2 Display reply form

TeamMember -> ConvDetailView : 3 Enter reply message
TeamMember -> ConvDetailView : 4 Click "Send" button

ConvDetailView -> ClerkAuth : 5 Send reply request
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 6 Store reply message
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 7 Update conversation record
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 8 Confirmation
ClerkAuth -> ConvDetailView : 9 Success notification
ConvDetailView -> TeamMember : 10 Display success message

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate ConvDetailView

@enduml
